{
  "$schema": "../docs/schemas/premium-rpc-paths.schema.json",
  "_doc": [
    "Reference list of the 33 endpoints that the original WorldMonitor",
    "gated via the legacy `PREMIUM_RPC_PATHS` Bearer-`role='pro'`",
    "code path (server/gateway.ts:312-358 in the source repo). Per",
    "SPEC-001 §14.4 the H4 fix retires that legacy path and folds",
    "every entry into `ENDPOINT_ENTITLEMENTS` so the gateway has a",
    "single tier-based gating mechanism.",
    "",
    "The original WorldMonitor source tree is not checked in to this",
    "rebuild; the entries below are reconstructed from the documented",
    "40-domain RPC matrix at SPEC-001 §11. Each path is a real",
    "`/api/{domain}/v1/{rpc}` shape that maps to a domain the original",
    "premium-gated, with tier 1 (Free) as the new equivalent of the",
    "legacy `role='pro'` requirement.",
    "",
    "When the original PREMIUM_RPC_PATHS reference list becomes",
    "available (e.g. by mounting the WorldMonitor source in /vendor),",
    "re-run `bun run tools/migrate-premium-paths.ts --regenerate` to",
    "rebuild this file and the generated `endpoint_tiers.rs` superset",
    "in lockstep.",
    "",
    "Each entry is `{ path, tier }` where `tier` is the numeric rank",
    "(0=Anonymous, 1=Free, 2=Tier1, 3=Tier2) from `Tier::rank()`."
  ],
  "version": 1,
